macOS 27 desktop (2026-11-22): touch as a pointer, frame pitch, root disk in Disk Arbitration, landscape.

- SweetHID: SweetHIDPointer (absolute pointer, finger 0 of the touchscreen); the press is sent after a move-only event
  and the release where the finger last was; the digitizer's own events are not sent on macOS (sweettouchdigi=1 does);
  positions turned with sweetfb_rot. Personality in KernelConfigTables.
- SweetFramebuffer: sweet_fb_bpr (plane 0's row pitch for WindowServer's padded '&BGA' frames); macOS screen
  rotated (sweetfb_rot, default 1) and divided (sweetfb_div, default 2: 1560x720), presentRotated.
- SweetMedia (new): IOMedia stand-in for /dev/ufsroot0 under an internal storage device, published by sweet_ufs.c,
  so Disk Arbitration knows the root volume (Finder's sidebar no longer aborts in LaunchServices).

